  Text: "ALL DONE! \n\r\nNo memories about tonight remain in his pubescent mind.\n\r\nWe
    inception-like inserted some happy recollections about a trip to the farm and
    petting a chicken. \n\r\nHe'll be fine and so will we. \n\nBut he wont be \"normal\"
    until he takes a good nap.\r\n"
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?

    The report is probably
    on your desk, or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
